          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200 mb-2">Usability Testing</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">Evaluating the design with users</p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Task details - right column on mobile, left column on desktop -->
        <div class="order-2 bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-neutral-900 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm md:order-1">
          <strong class="block text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200 mb-1">Think-Aloud Testing</strong>
          <div class="text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">Identified issues with aesthetic consistency and manual findability</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 7 -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto_1fr] gap-4 md:gap-8 items-start md:items-center relative">
      <!-- Mobile & desktop timeline number -->
      <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-amber-500 text-white font-bold z-10 md:order-2">7</div>
      
      <!-- Content container for mobile - stacks vertically -->
      <div class="grid gap-4 md:contents">
        <!-- Phase title - right column on mobile, left column on desktop -->
        <div class="order-1 md:order-1 md:text-right">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200 mb-2">Design Refinement</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">Improving based on user feedback</p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Task details - right column on mobile, right column on desktop -->
        <div class="order-2 bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-neutral-900 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm md:order-3">
          <strong class="block text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200 mb-1">Usability Improvements</strong>
          <div class="text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">Added more placeholder images, created animated infographic, improved manual findability</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 8 -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto_1fr] gap-4 md:gap-8 items-start md:items-center relative">
      <!-- Mobile & desktop timeline number -->
      <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-amber-500 text-white font-bold z-10 md:order-2">8</div>
      
      <!-- Content container for mobile - stacks vertically -->
      <div class="grid gap-4 md:contents">
        <!-- Phase title - right column on mobile, right column on desktop -->
        <div class="order-1 md:order-3">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200 mb-2">Project Estimation</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">Planning for development</p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Task details - right column on mobile, left column on desktop -->
        <div class="order-2 bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-neutral-900 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm md:order-1">
          <strong class="block text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200 mb-1">Delphi Method</strong>
          <div class="text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">Used Delphi estimation with three experts for time/cost planning, added 15% contingency</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

        <!-- Visual system section with color palette -->
        <section class="mb-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-neutral-50 to-amber-50 dark:from-neutral-900 dark:to-amber-950 p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute -right-20 -top-20 w-80 h-80 bg-amber-200 dark:bg-amber-800 rounded-full opacity-20 blur-3xl"></div>
          
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-8 flex items-center gap-3 text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-100 relative z-10">
            <IconPalette className="w-8 h-8 text-amber-500" />
            <span>Visual System</span>
          </h2>
          
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 relative z-10">
            <div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2">
              <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mb-6">
                A clean, warm-toned visual system that reflects the comfort and environmental focus of the Firefly product, using earthy colors that evoke wood and fire elements.
              </p>
              
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-8">
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
                  <div class="h-24 w-24 rounded-xl" style="background-color: #D37E47"></div>
                  <span class="text-sm font-mono text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300">#D37E47</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
                  <div class="h-24 w-24 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700" style="background-color: #FBFCFC"></div>
                  <span class="text-sm font-mono text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300">#FBFCFC</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
                  <div class="h-24 w-24 rounded-xl" style="background-color: #625443"></div>
                  <span class="text-sm font-mono text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300">#625443</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-10">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-100 mb-4">Typography</h3>
                <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-neutral-800 rounded-xl">
                  <p class="font-[Cardo] text-3xl text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-100">Cardo (serif) type family</p>
                  <p class="font-[Cardo] mt-2 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">Used for both headings and body text to create a cohesive, elegant experience</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="relative">
              <div class="sticky top-24 bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-100">Design Tools</h3>
                <div class="space-y-4">
                  <div>
                    <div class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 mb-1">Primary tools</div>
                    <div class="text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">Figma, FigJam</div>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <Button asChild variant="outline" className="w-full justify-between">
                      <a href="https://www.figma.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        Learn about Figma
                        <IconArrowRight className="h-4 w-4" />
                      </a>
                    </Button>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Research and Audience in an alternating layout -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 mb-24">
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-8 flex items-center gap-3 text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-100">
              <IconSearch className="w-8 h-8 text-amber-500" />
              <span>Research Findings</span>
            </h2>
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                <span class="w-3 h-3 mt-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 flex-shrink-0"></span>
                <div>
                  <strong class="block text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">Internal Factors</strong>
                  <div class="text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">Simple, effective solutions that improve stove performance and reduce environmental impact</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                <span class="w-3 h-3 mt-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 flex-shrink-0"></span>
