                  <strong class="block text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">External Trends</strong>
                  <div class="text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">Rising interest in sustainable, energy-efficient home solutions with focus on CO₂ reduction</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                <span class="w-3 h-3 mt-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 flex-shrink-0"></span>
