                <span class="w-3 h-3 mt-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 flex-shrink-0"></span>
                <div>
                  <strong class="block text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">Primary Audience</strong>
                  <div class="text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">Danish homeowners with wood-burning stoves—especially single-family homes built before 1951 in Aarhus, Aalborg, and Viborg</div>
                </div>
